Package: lumo-greeter
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: sddm, fonts-inter, lumo-theme
# (sddm pulls the complete Qt6 QML module set its greeters need)
Description: Lumo OS greeter (SDDM theme)
 Custom SDDM QML login screen for Lumo OS: aurora wallpaper, centered
 clock, dark glass login card with user picker, password field, session
 chooser and power controls, all driven by the real SDDM greeter API.
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/salom600/lumo-os
